#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:5
msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "导出设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows predefining export settings for reducing the working "
"configuration effort each time that a `project`_ have to be exported."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许预先定义导出设置，以减少每次必须导出 `项目 <project_>`_ 时的配置工作。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:10
msgid "The default exporting settings which can be chosen are:"
msgstr "可以选择的默认导出设置包括："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:12
msgid "Default target directory."
msgstr "默认目标目录。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:13
msgid ""
"Default exporting format (**PNG**, **JPEG**, **Bitmap**, **SVG** or "
"**DXF**)."
msgstr "默认导出格式（ **PNG** 、 **JPEG** 、 **Bitmap** 、 **SVG** 或 **DXF** ）。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:14
msgid "Default rendering options:"
msgstr "默认渲染选项："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:15
msgid "Draw or not borders."
msgstr "是否绘制边框。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:16
msgid "Title block."
msgstr "图框。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:17
msgid "Draw grid."
msgstr "绘制网格。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:18
msgid "Draw terminals."
msgstr "绘制端子。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:19
msgid "Keep conductor colors or monochrome."
msgstr "保留导体颜色或使用单色。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:21
msgid "To define default export settings:"
msgstr "要定义默认导出设置："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:23
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech 设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:24
msgid "Go to **Export** section."
msgstr "转到 **导出** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:25
msgid "Select the desired setting values for each field."
msgstr "为每个字段选择所需的设置值。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:26
msgid "Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech export settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 导出设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_export.rst:35
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech export options, refer to `export`_ "
"section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 导出选项的更多信息，请参阅 `导出 <export_>`_ 一节。"
